{"version":1,"content":"<p>當地時間周三，在美國汽油和柴油價格持續高企之際，資深參議員伯尼·桑德斯猛烈抨擊了美國總統特朗普。此前，特朗普吹噓了其位於佛羅裏達州的私人住所「海湖莊園」供應的5000美元一份的漢堡。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584274.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T06:32:48.953769+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:24:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:29:29.823005+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:29:29.823005+00:00","content_hash":"2d7892459c4210641b37650e5d6733c8b3b093d6699133cc235d5c206771b77e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}